==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Use [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] on the initial Mistress Celeboodle to steal all of her riches, then rush the base with units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to avoid dealing with the Zapies.

